 {name:'trim_video',label:'ตัดช่วงวิดีโอ',description:'Trim an existing published video to start/end seconds, preserving its actual audio. Use list_generated_files to select its exact video ID, including videos from earlier messages. Without an ID, trims the latest published video in this chat. Creates a new output; never overwrites. Call only when the user requests trimming.',parameters:Type.Object({id:Type.Optional(Type.String({format:'uuid'})),start:Type.Number({minimum:0}),end:Type.Number({exclusiveMinimum:0})},{additionalProperties:false}),execute:async(_id,args)=>{
